models/ holds that repository's det.onnx, rec.onnx, rec2.onnx, det.yml, rec_dict.txt and config.json,
unchanged, with its NOTICE (models/NOTICE), which credits PaddlePaddle PP-OCRv6-tiny (Apache-2.0).

vendor/opencv/opencv-ocr.mjs is a build of OpenCV 5.0.0 (Apache License 2.0, Copyright the OpenCV team),
compiled to WebAssembly from source in which modules/js/src/core_bindings.cpp has one added line
(an empty namespace declaration); see vendor/opencv/build/build.sh.

Runtime dependencies installed from npm: onnxruntime-web (MIT, Microsoft), clipper-lib (Boost Software
License 1.0, Angus Johnson).
